e**: [icreststore.in/apple-student-discount-offers](https://icreststore.in/apple-student-discount-offers/)\n- **Deals**: End-of-Season sales + \"Loan Mela\" EMI promotions\n- 🔗 [icreststore.in](https://icreststore.in)\n\n---\n\n### 🔵 Tier 3: Big retailers with bank offers (no student-specific portals online)\n\n#### 11. Croma (450+ stores, Tata Group)\n- **Clearance prices verified**:\n  - 14\" M3 (8GB/512GB): **₹1,09,994** ← lowest price found anywhere\n  - 14\" M3 (8GB/1TB): **₹1,42,994**\n  - 14\" M3 Max (36GB/1TB): **₹2,59,994**\n- **Student**: 5-10% \"Back to Campus\" in-store with college ID\n- **Bonus**: 5% NeuCoins back with Tata Neu HDFC Infinity card\n- 🔗 [croma.com](https://www.croma.com)\n\n#### 12. Vijay Sales (140+ stores)\n- **Pricing**: Promotional cuts during \"Apple Days\"\n- **Bank offers**: HDFC EMI up to ₹15,000 off; Amex/OneCard up to ₹20,000 off\n- **Student**: In-store negotiation with college ID (no online portal)\n- **Bonus**: Free 3-hour delivery in metros\n- 🔗 [vijaysales.com](https://www.vijaysales.com)\n\n#### 13. Reliance Digital / JioMart (600+ stores)\n- **Pricing**: MBP 14\" from ₹1,45,900 during sales\n- **Bank offers**: Up to ₹10,000 ICICI/SBI cashback\n- **Student**: \"Digital College Fest\" in-store bundles\n- **Bonus**: Will price-match nearby Croma/Vijay Sales quotes\n- 🔗 [reliancedigital.in](https://www.reliancedigital.in)\n\n#### 14. Poorvika (South India, 470+ stores)\n- **Pricing**: MBP 14\" from ₹1,45,900–₹1,69,900\n- **Student**: In-store bargaining + free accessory bundles\n- 🔗 [poorvika.com](https://www.poorvika.com)\n\n#### 15. Paytm Mall (Online clearance)\n- **CTO Clearance pricing**: MBP 14\" CTO at **₹1,34,940** (was ₹2,24,900)\n- **Caution**: Check seller is authorized Apple distributor\n- 🔗 [paytmmall.com](https://paytmmall.com)\n\n---\n\n### 🔴 Also worth knowing (NOT resellers, but useful)\n\n| Platform | What it does | Link |\n|---|---|---|\n| **IndiaiStore** | Official Apple distributor portal — aggregates all APR bank offers (₹10K–₹15K cashback) | [indiaistore.com](https://www.indiaistore.com) |\n| **Apple India Education Store** | Direct from Apple — ₹10K–₹20K off + free AirPods (until Sept 24!) + 20% off AppleCare | [apple.com/in-edu/shop](https://www.apple.com/in-edu/shop) |\n| **UNiDAYS** | Student verification for Apple Education Store | [myunidays.com/IN](https://www.myunidays.com/IN/en-IN) |\n| **DesiDime** | Community deal forum — tracks price glitches and hidden coupons | [desidime.com](https://www.desidime.com) |\n| **PriceBefore** | Price history tracker — verify if a \"deal\" is really at all-time low | [pricebefore.com](https://pricebefore.com) |\n| **Buyhatke** | Chrome extension — auto-applies coupons + price drop alerts | [buyhatke.com](https://buyhatke.com) |\n| **CashKaro** | Extra 1.5–3.5% real cashback on Croma/Reliance/Vijay Sales orders | [cashkaro.com](https://cashkaro.com) |\n\n---\n\n## 🎯 The Maximum Savings Strategy (Stack Everything)\n\n### If buying RIGHT NOW (before Sept 24, 2026):\n\n```\nStep 1: Go to Apple Education Store via UNiDAYS\n        → ₹13,000–₹20,000 off MRP\n        → FREE AirPods (worth ₹14,900)\n        → 20% off AppleCare+\n        \nTotal value: ~₹25,000–₹35,000 saved\n```\n\n### If buying a previous-gen sealed unit for max discount:\n\n```\nStep 1: Check Unicorn Store \"Hot Deals\" or Croma clearance\n        → 25–35% off MRP (₹50,000–₹80,000 saved)\n        \nStep 2: Stack bank card cashback\n        → HDFC/ICICI/Amex EMI = ₹10,000–₹20,000 more off\n        \nStep 3: Exchange old laptop\n        → ₹5,000–₹10,000 trade-in bonus\n\nTotal saved: ₹65,000–₹1,10,000 off original MRP\n```\n\n### If buying current-gen at lowest cash price:\n\n```\nStep 1: Visit Aptronix or Imagine Store with Student ID\n        → 7–10% education discount\n        \nStep 2: Pay with HDFC/Amex EMI\n        → ₹10,000–₹20,000 instant cashback\n        \nStep 3: Route purchase through CashKaro\n        → Extra 1.5–3.5% real cashback\n\nStep 4: Exchange old laptop via Cashify\n        → ₹5,000–₹10,000 bonus\n\nTotal saved: ₹30,000–₹45,000\n```\n\n---\n\n## ⚠️ What Documents to Keep Ready\n\nCarry these when visiting any store:\n\n1. **College Student ID** (with visible validity date / current academic year)\n2. **Admission letter OR latest semester fee receipt**\n3. **Aadhaar Card** (government photo ID)\n4. **Parent's credit card** (if using parent's HDFC/ICICI card for bank cashback)\n","Description":"Complete guide to every Apple reseller in India with student deals and clearance sections, synthesized from 3 parallel research agents.","Overwrite":false,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\renu5\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\b764a5db-2187-47e2-b019-8f596935f002\\apple-reseller-student-deals-india.md","toolAction":"Creating final report","toolSummary":"Student deals report"}}]}
